  "body": "From the moment you step through the double height entryway accented with polished tiles and a dramatic crystal light it is clear that 10 Pioneer Rise is a residence of distinction. Spanning an expansive 300m2 floor plan on a fully fenced 673m2 (more or less) section, this exceptional home seamlessly blends generous family proportions with high end modern upgrades tailored for effortless entertaining. The crown jewel is the addition of beautiful big bifold servery windows, opening directly out to the outdoor entertaining area.\r\n\r\nTHE KITCHEN & ENTERTAINING\r\n* New High-Spec Kitchen: Completely transformed to a luxury standard with premium finishes, expansive work surfaces, and ample storage.\r\n* Entertainer's Servery: Stunning bifold windows open directly from the kitchen out to the entertaining deck, keeping you connected with guests.\r\n* All-Weather Outdoor Room: Covered by a custom structural shelter and fitted with drop-down blinds, allowing you to host year-round, rain or shine.\r\n* Private Retreat: Includes a resort-style spa pool to unwind at the end of the day.\r\n* Room for a Swimming Pool: The flat, generous backyard offers ample space to install a full in-ground swimming pool.\r\n\r\nFLEXIBLE MULTI-GENERATIONAL LAYOUT\r\n*  3 Distinct Living Zones: Features a formal lounge opening to the deck, an open-plan family/dining area anchored by dark wide-plank flooring, and a light-filled upstairs retreat.\r\n* 5 Double Bedrooms: Smartly separated with 2 bedrooms downstairs and 3 upstairs.\r\n* Luxury Master Suite: Complete with a walk-in wardrobe, an ensuite featuring twin basins, and pleasant water views.\r\n* 3 Bathrooms + 2 Separate Toilets: High-end finishes throughout, including floating vanities, glass showers, floor-to-ceiling tiling, and underfloor heating.\r\n\r\nPRACTICAL FEATURES\r\n* Double carpeted garage with internal access, plus off-street parking spaces.\r\n* Dedicated separate laundry with external access.\r\n* Incredible storage capacity, including a walk-in storage room and under-house space.\r\n* New High Spec Culinary Kitchen\r\n* Fully fenced perfect for pets and children\r\n* Views of Orewa and the ocean from upstairs\r\n\r\n\r\nPRIME MILLWATER LOCATION\r\nEnjoy an unbeatable coastal lifestyle. Walk with ease to local pre-schools, top schools, neighborhood shops, and the popular Millwater cycleway and walking track. Silverdale's retail, commercial, and dining hubs are just a short drive away, along with easy highway access for commuters.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with Dylan or Zoe today to make this family home yours!",
